A||||6||mshill||Where to get blue cap and plug wires (8mm)||||1||
Z||000000||mshill||01-17-2001||09:18 PM||||Since I am going to a whole bunch of trouble to dress up my engine and engine compartment, I want to put in a blue dist cap and 8mm blue plug wires.<P>Anyone have any part numbers off hand that might fit the bill and where to go shopping for them.  I hate to order anything like this from carparts.com or wrenchhead.com cause who knows what you will really get.||||reg||1
Z||000001||2birds||01-17-2001||09:52 PM||||Taylor Spiro-pro wires can be had in pretty much any color, and the boots don't need heat shields or break, either.  I got mine from Summitt for around $30 in red.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||AkursedX||01-17-2001||10:15 PM||||Well you can get 8mm splitfire plugs from the Fierostore, I believe they are $40. (I have them on my car, they look good)  As for a blue distributor cap, I had one on my car when I bought it, it was sky blue though.  But I have changed it since then, but somebody out there makes one.  Good luck in your hunt.||||reg||7
